# nanopb options for c2s.proto
#
# ServerData.data is the opaque blob the server forwards between session peers.
# In the relay it carries a *serialized NFCData* (c2c.proto). It must therefore
# hold an NFCData whose own .data is up to 512 B, plus that message's protobuf
# field overhead (tags, varint lengths, data_source/data_type/timestamp): ~600 B.
#
# The leading '*' wildcard matches the fully-qualified name
# (de.tu_darmstadt.seemoo.nfcgate.network.c2s.ServerData.data) regardless of package.
*ServerData.data  max_size:600
